.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH g-merge 1  "g-merge " 
.SH NAME
g\-merge \- Resolve merge conflicts interactively
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBg\-merge\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolve merge conflicts interactively
.PP
Opens a three\-pane TUI showing LOCAL (ours), BASE, and REMOTE (theirs) versions side by side.  Navigate conflicts with n/p, resolve with l/r/b, and save with Ctrl\-S when all conflicts are resolved.
.PP
If no file is specified, finds all files with conflict markers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
File with conflict markers to resolve
